# TR Necrom: "Bad Spirits" (TR_m2_Nm_Drunk). Rilam Arelas, outdoors in Necrom, worries about Nedim Fareloth ("Is he in
# danger?" 1, "Maybe I could help?" 2: 10, his door key). Nedim, drunk at home, sends the player off (20); Rilam
# wants him taken to the Lovers' shrine on the causeway (30). Nedim won't go out without his shirt; found ("I found
# it." 1) he follows (40). Within 650 of the shrine (TR_m2_q_A9_2_NedimScript) his greeting logs 50; Rilam pays (60,
# "I'll take the hackle-lo." 10).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the player's travel, the escort's too: the Lovers' shrine stands on a navmesh
# island the city's mesh does not reach, so `walk` finds no path. Nedim follows on his own. Refs carry TR_Mainland's
# slot 09: 09EB0978 the shirt, 09DC6D19 the house door.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_nm_scout_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case nm_drunk_start
run
player->Position 356750 -86650 840 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Rilam Arelas"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Rilam Arelas
ask Nedim Fareloth
choose 1
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3962 6650 21375 0 "Necrom, Nedim Fareloth's House"
until 600 "TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth
ask Nedim Fareloth
bye
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 20
run
player->Position 356750 -86650 840 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Rilam Arelas"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 60
talk TR_m2_Rilam Arelas
ask Nedim Fareloth
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 30
bye
end

case nm_drunk_shirt
run
player->PositionCell 3962 6650 21375 0 "Necrom, Nedim Fareloth's House"
until 600 "TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth
ask Nedim Fareloth
bye
take 09EB0978
until 300 player->GetItemCount "TR_m2_q_A9_2_NedimShirt" >= 1
talk TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 40
bye
end

case nm_drunk_shrine
activate 09DC6D19
until 600 GetPCCell "Necrom" == 1
wait 120
run
player->Position 340564 -80300 1300 0
until 3600 "TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth".controlQ == 10
talk TR_m2_Nedim Fareloth
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 50
bye
end

case nm_drunk_done
run
player->Position 356750 -86650 840 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Rilam Arelas"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Rilam Arelas
ask Nedim Fareloth
choose 10
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Drunk == 60
bye
end
